<h2 id="mime">MIME</h2>

<div id="issue-37">

ISSUE: We need to check if there are any relevant MIME parameters for <code>model/*</code> content
  (if any). <a href="https://github.com/immersive-web/model-element/issues/37">GitHub issue #37:
  MIME integration</a>.

</div>

<h3 id="mime-sniffing">MIME Sniffing</h3>

<div id="issue-38">

ISSUE: Need to describe how we sniff for MIME types in [[MIMESNIFF]]. See also IANA &quot;<a
  href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml#model">model</a>&quot; types.
  We might need specific rules for sniffing. <a
  href="https://github.com/immersive-web/model-element/issues/38">GitHub issue #38: Enforce MIME
  types</a>.

</div>

<div id="issue-summary" data-fill-with="issues-index"></div>

